# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cc — Pattern Syntax
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Syntax Rules:
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - ! negates a pattern (includes previously excluded)
#   - / at end means directory only
#   - * matches anything except /
#   - ** matches across directories

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Co — Ignore Patterns
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Build Artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled binaries and build output — generated, not source.

# Compiled binaries
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.out

# Object files
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib

# Build directories
/build/
/dist/
/out/
/bin/
/target/

# [Project-specific build artifacts]
# [Add your build output directories here]

# ─── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# External packages managed by package managers.

# Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Go
/vendor/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
venv/
ENV/
.venv/

# Rust
/target/
Cargo.lock

# [Project-specific dependencies]
# [Add your dependency directories here]

# ─── IDE and Editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local configuration not shared across team.

# VSCode (keep .vscode/settings.json if sharing project settings)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# JetBrains IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# Vim
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.netrwhist

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
/.emacs.desktop
/.emacs.desktop.lock
*.elc

# [Project-specific IDE files]
# [Add your IDE-specific ignores here]

# ─── Environment and Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials and sensitive configuration — NEVER commit these.

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.test
.env.production

# Credentials and keys
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.json

# API keys and tokens
.api-key
.token

# [Project-specific secrets]
# [Add patterns for any project-specific sensitive files]

# ─── OS Generated ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# System files that vary by machine.

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~
.directory

# ─── Logs and Temporary ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated logs, temp files, and test output.

# Logs
*.log
logs/
log/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.backup
.cache/
tmp/
temp/

# Coverage and test results
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ─── Project-Specific ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [Add project-specific patterns below]

# [Example: Ignore generated documentation]
# /docs/generated/

# [Example: Ignore local configuration overrides]
# *.local.yaml

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cv — Validation and Security
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Verify Commands:
#   git check-ignore -v [file]    # Check if file would be ignored
#   git status --ignored          # List all ignored files
#   git rm --cached [file]        # Untrack already-committed file
#
# Common Issues:
#   "File still tracked" — Already committed files need: git rm --cached [file]
#   "Pattern not working" — Check for typos, trailing spaces
#   "Too many files ignored" — Pattern may be too broad, use ! to negate
#
# If secrets were accidentally committed:
#   1. Rotate ALL exposed credentials immediately
#   2. Use BFG or git filter-repo to remove from history
#   3. Force push (coordinate with team)
#   4. Review access logs for unauthorized use

